WEBVTT

01:27.985 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:34.945 --> 01:35.825
Cangcang,

01:36.505 --> 01:38.825
I know you've misunderstood me before.

01:39.345 --> 01:42.385
Could you give me one more chance
to let us start over?

01:43.905 --> 01:45.145
Okay?

01:53.825 --> 01:55.145
Come catch me!

02:00.425 --> 02:02.185
You don't have to answer me now.

02:02.825 --> 02:04.745
I'll stay right by your side

02:05.265 --> 02:07.105
until you come to me of your own accord.

02:07.745 --> 02:08.785
Thank you.

02:10.024 --> 02:11.105
Stilts!

02:11.185 --> 02:13.065
Mom, it's stilts!

02:13.625 --> 02:14.985
Father, come quick.

02:15.065 --> 02:16.225
They're on stilts!

02:23.705 --> 02:25.265
They're lighting fireworks!

02:27.425 --> 02:28.665
So pretty!

02:38.545 --> 02:39.385
So beautiful!

02:47.145 --> 02:48.025
So beautiful!

02:55.825 --> 02:57.185
There are fireworks!

02:58.305 --> 02:59.345
Fireworks!

02:59.425 --> 03:00.465
So beautiful!

03:13.265 --> 03:14.545
I didn't mean it.

03:15.745 --> 03:17.225
Someone bumped into me just now.

03:17.305 --> 03:18.425
It was just a coincidence.

03:20.905 --> 03:23.625
Have you ever thought that sometimes,

03:24.145 --> 03:27.185
coincidence is just destiny in disguise?

04:29.385 --> 04:30.265
I've arrived.

04:30.785 --> 04:32.305
Your Majesty, you should head back soon.

04:34.065 --> 04:35.145
I'm tired too.

04:35.865 --> 04:37.185
I want to go in and rest.

04:44.745 --> 04:46.425
All right. I'll stop teasing you.

04:48.145 --> 04:49.505
Have a piece whenever you're sad.

04:49.585 --> 04:51.065
Then your heart won't feel so bitter.

04:58.945 --> 05:00.745
About today, thank you.

05:02.305 --> 05:04.425
You never need to thank me.

05:16.745 --> 05:17.785
Oh, right.

05:19.825 --> 05:22.745
Aren't you going to ask me
who I met at the tavern today?

05:24.185 --> 05:25.985
I trust my empress.

05:34.385 --> 05:35.625
All right.

05:35.705 --> 05:38.425
It's chilly out here.
Go in and get some rest.

06:18.065 --> 06:20.545
PURE AND SPOTLESS

06:20.625 --> 06:21.465
Your Majesty.

06:22.785 --> 06:24.425
The Empress Dowager's spies
planted by the Empress's side

06:24.505 --> 06:25.825
have all been cleared out.

06:26.345 --> 06:28.345
How can she still track
the Empress's movements?

06:30.025 --> 06:32.705
Someone outside Linghe Hall
intercepted Her Majesty's carrier pigeon.

06:32.785 --> 06:35.385
To keep Her Majesty from noticing,
they released the pigeon again.

06:35.465 --> 06:38.585
-I don't want to see this happen again.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

06:39.185 --> 06:40.585
Keep a close eye on the Empress Dowager.

06:40.665 --> 06:43.185
If there's the slightest stir,
do not overlook it.

06:43.825 --> 06:44.665
Today,

06:44.745 --> 06:46.665
thanks to a guard in her palace
tipping us off.

06:47.385 --> 06:48.785
Reward the informant handsomely.

06:50.425 --> 06:51.465
As you command.

06:51.985 --> 06:55.265
Also, Prince of Yuzhang has sent word
that everything is going smoothly.

06:56.745 --> 06:58.265
This ninth brother of mine

06:58.345 --> 07:01.705
is much easier to deal with
than his mother.

07:03.745 --> 07:06.545
Recommended officials, enter the hall!

07:07.145 --> 07:10.345
The final imperial exam now begins!

07:35.785 --> 07:36.705
In today's palace examination,

07:37.425 --> 07:39.665
all of you must give it your best.

07:39.745 --> 07:41.385
Do not let down my expectations.

08:10.385 --> 08:12.545
PALACE EXAM CANDIDATE: SONG LANXI

08:53.945 --> 08:54.905
Very well.

08:55.505 --> 08:57.145
I'll review the papers as soon as I can.

08:57.225 --> 08:59.265
Please wait patiently for the good news.

08:59.345 --> 09:00.345
Wait.

09:05.705 --> 09:07.985
Your Majesty, in my view,

09:09.705 --> 09:11.945
there is something false

09:12.465 --> 09:14.865
about Mr. Song Lanxi's identity.

09:16.265 --> 09:18.505
Grand Tutor Ling,
what do you mean by that?

09:19.105 --> 09:20.625
This candidate

09:24.505 --> 09:26.425
is clearly a woman.

09:35.465 --> 09:36.465
Mr. Song,

09:37.985 --> 09:40.105
do you dare take off your hat

09:40.185 --> 09:41.745
and let everyone

09:42.825 --> 09:44.465
have a good look?

09:48.385 --> 09:49.545
Mr. Song,

09:49.625 --> 09:51.625
didn't you hear what the Grand Tutor said?

09:51.705 --> 09:54.225
Take off your hat and raise your head.

10:22.985 --> 10:24.865
-Oh…
-She really is a woman.

10:26.025 --> 10:27.865
This is outrageous!

10:29.705 --> 10:30.545
Yeah.

10:30.625 --> 10:31.945
Far too outrageous.

10:32.025 --> 10:33.225
She really is a woman.

10:33.305 --> 10:34.825
That's deceiving the Emperor!

10:34.905 --> 10:36.345
-Yeah.
-Exactly.

10:36.425 --> 10:37.465
Such nerve.

10:39.145 --> 10:40.585
This is beyond all decorum.

10:43.185 --> 10:44.505
We absolutely can't let her off lightly.

10:45.465 --> 10:47.025
You impudent woman,

10:47.105 --> 10:49.105
how dare you pose as an imperial official?

10:53.345 --> 10:55.145
Grand Tutor Ling, you're mistaken.

10:55.985 --> 10:59.265
Mr. Song Lanxi has always been a woman.

11:02.465 --> 11:03.505
Although in our dynasty,

11:03.585 --> 11:05.745
there have long been
women serving as officials,

11:06.385 --> 11:08.145
Mr. Song keeps a low profile,

11:08.225 --> 11:09.945
rarely appears in public,

11:10.025 --> 11:11.145
and often dresses as a man.

11:11.225 --> 11:15.065
So only a very few people know
that Mr. Song is a woman.

11:21.785 --> 11:23.465
Your Majesty has long been shut away
in the palace.

11:23.545 --> 11:26.025
I fear someone with an agenda
is deceiving you.

11:26.105 --> 11:28.665
Song Lanxi
comes from a great family in Gusu,

11:28.745 --> 11:29.825
renowned far and wide.

11:29.905 --> 11:31.665
How could he possibly be a woman?

11:31.745 --> 11:33.745
His calligraphy is bold and forceful,

11:33.825 --> 11:35.825
clearly a man's hand.

11:36.745 --> 11:37.905
The witness is right here.

11:37.985 --> 11:39.505
Who dares question it?

12:03.985 --> 12:05.265
Xiao Qianqing.

12:05.785 --> 12:07.985
Li Chengtian.

12:08.505 --> 12:10.465
Pay our respects, Your Majesty.

12:11.185 --> 12:12.025
Rise.

12:15.145 --> 12:16.305
Song Lanxi

12:16.385 --> 12:19.145
is a disciple of Master Li Chengtian.

12:20.665 --> 12:22.865
Master Li himself is here today.

12:23.465 --> 12:24.465
Who would dare talk nonsense?

12:26.145 --> 12:27.185
Mr. Ling,

12:27.705 --> 12:29.225
it's been a long time.

12:30.585 --> 12:32.385
Yes, a very long time.

12:33.665 --> 12:34.705
Back then,

12:34.785 --> 12:38.025
you resigned and returned home.

12:39.505 --> 12:42.105
I simply couldn't keep you.

12:43.465 --> 12:44.745
And now,

12:45.625 --> 12:47.385
what brings you back?

12:50.385 --> 12:52.745
Back then, the court reeked of corruption.

12:53.705 --> 12:57.305
I refused to join in the filth.

12:57.385 --> 12:59.865
Now, the world is slowly growing cleaner.

13:01.225 --> 13:03.745
So I'm willing to come out of retirement.

13:06.225 --> 13:07.345
After all these years,

13:07.425 --> 13:10.785
your tongue is still sharp as a blade.

13:12.985 --> 13:16.065
That depends on who I'm facing.

13:21.145 --> 13:22.265
Master Li,

13:22.905 --> 13:26.265
may I ask whether there is any problem
with Mr. Song Lanxi's identity?

13:28.105 --> 13:29.945
Lanxi,

13:30.025 --> 13:31.505
I've told you long ago:

13:32.345 --> 13:33.585
no matter when,

13:33.665 --> 13:35.745
you must stand tall.

13:35.825 --> 13:39.745
It's nothing more than some schemer
failing to have you killed

13:39.825 --> 13:42.065
and now trying to sling mud instead.

13:43.625 --> 13:45.985
As your teacher, I'll stand up for you!

14:00.585 --> 14:01.665
Since that's the case,

14:01.745 --> 14:04.905
I ask all of you to wait for
the results of the palace exam.

14:14.705 --> 14:16.905
Not even a word of praise for me.

14:17.585 --> 14:19.425
Using me and then kicking me away,

14:19.505 --> 14:20.985
how heartless of you!

14:27.065 --> 14:28.225
Grand Tutor Ling.

14:28.305 --> 14:30.625
TAIJI HALL

14:30.705 --> 14:32.825
You've schemed for years,

14:32.905 --> 14:35.545
and now your career is about to collapse.

14:36.265 --> 14:39.225
You must have lost your mind

14:39.305 --> 14:41.105
after the loss of your beloved daughter.

14:41.625 --> 14:43.865
Why are you talking such nonsense?

14:47.265 --> 14:49.785
Don't provoke me like this.

14:50.385 --> 14:51.945
This whole situation now

14:52.465 --> 14:54.705
is all thanks to your fine disciple.

14:55.305 --> 14:58.145
You're not much better off than I am.

15:08.345 --> 15:12.745
WRITING

15:20.385 --> 15:21.705
Greetings, Your Majesty.

15:30.905 --> 15:31.985
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

15:32.065 --> 15:33.185
You turned things around
in the palace exam.

15:33.785 --> 15:37.105
You specially summoned me here
just to offer congratulations?

15:38.705 --> 15:40.625
Yesterday, Imperial Physician Li
sent someone over

15:41.145 --> 15:42.265
and had the Frost Reed delivered.

15:44.825 --> 15:46.105
So he has really found it?

15:46.185 --> 15:49.065
With this key herb
that can dispel all poisons,

15:49.145 --> 15:51.585
your cold sickness may finally be cured.

15:54.145 --> 15:55.225
That's wonderful.

15:56.465 --> 15:59.225
I've specially prepared a banquet
to celebrate for Your Majesty.

16:00.225 --> 16:02.385
Thanks for your kindness,
but I still have matters to attend to.

16:02.985 --> 16:04.265
I'll take my leave.

16:05.105 --> 16:06.305
Your Majesty just can't wait

16:07.305 --> 16:08.745
to share this good news

16:09.585 --> 16:11.145
with the Empress, is that it?

16:14.305 --> 16:16.385
That is between the Empress and me.

16:17.025 --> 16:17.945
Mind your words.

16:33.785 --> 16:34.985
In that case,

16:36.585 --> 16:38.025
I wish Your Majesty

16:38.705 --> 16:40.265
long life and endless blessings.

16:40.825 --> 16:42.225
May you find joy,

16:42.305 --> 16:43.505
find the one you love,

16:44.865 --> 16:46.425
and never be lost in doubt again.

16:50.585 --> 16:53.185
Madam, don't let stray desires take root.

16:54.985 --> 16:56.225
All of you, leave.

16:57.505 --> 16:58.345
Yes, Madam.

17:15.345 --> 17:16.585
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

17:18.065 --> 17:19.585
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

17:20.385 --> 17:21.585
Your Highness!

17:22.385 --> 17:23.704
I want to go out.

17:26.184 --> 17:27.464
If you won't let me out, fine.

17:29.065 --> 17:30.185
How about this?

17:30.865 --> 17:33.545
Pick one of you to stand right here
so I can "light a lantern" on him.

17:35.025 --> 17:36.265
Please spare us!

17:37.825 --> 17:39.145
What is the Princess up to now?

17:39.225 --> 17:41.425
Commander Li,
you'll see once you're there.

17:43.865 --> 17:46.105
Actually, we don't even need fire.

17:46.185 --> 17:49.225
One of these days
I'll sprinkle some powder on you,

17:50.305 --> 17:52.625
and it'll burst into flame
at night all on its own.

17:53.825 --> 17:54.745
It'll be so much fun!

17:55.625 --> 17:57.145
Spare us, Your Highness!

18:02.345 --> 18:03.425
Your Highness.

18:03.945 --> 18:05.305
Please stop causing trouble.

18:06.905 --> 18:07.945
What?

18:08.025 --> 18:09.305
Want to punish me
by putting out the lights again?

18:10.545 --> 18:12.225
I'm telling you, my brother is back.

18:12.305 --> 18:13.705
-I'm not scared anymore!
-Forgive me.

18:16.265 --> 18:18.585
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

18:18.665 --> 18:19.945
You mustn't do that!

18:22.145 --> 18:25.225
If my powder hadn't been destroyed,
you'd already be dead!

18:25.865 --> 18:28.345
I have so many kinds of poison.
Deadly with just a touch!

18:44.025 --> 18:44.905
Your Highness,

18:46.465 --> 18:47.785
what are you trying to do?

18:52.385 --> 18:53.985
Whatever you want me to do,

18:56.345 --> 18:57.185
I'll do it.

19:01.545 --> 19:02.545
Say it…

19:03.065 --> 19:04.105
what do you want me to do?

19:06.665 --> 19:08.065
I would like Your Highness

19:08.785 --> 19:11.425
to spare my men
and go back to your chambers to rest.

19:14.065 --> 19:14.905
Fine.

19:21.305 --> 19:22.305
How long do I have to rest?

19:24.505 --> 19:27.185
How about you rest until tomorrow?

19:28.865 --> 19:29.785
All right.

19:39.745 --> 19:41.105
I'll go rest now.

19:42.385 --> 19:43.465
See you tomorrow.

19:48.705 --> 19:51.705
Finding you makes me really happy.

20:12.785 --> 20:13.625
Sir.

20:13.705 --> 20:14.865
-Are you okay?
-Are you alright?

20:15.385 --> 20:16.265
What are you looking at?

20:19.025 --> 20:20.225
Do I look that bad?

20:23.865 --> 20:25.385
Am I poisoned or something?

20:35.185 --> 20:36.025
Your Majesty,

20:36.105 --> 20:38.065
this is the pear blossom honey
Grand Tutor Ling brought today.

20:38.145 --> 20:39.625
I added four spoonfuls,
just as he ordered.

20:39.705 --> 20:40.945
It really does smell sweet.

20:44.785 --> 20:46.625
Whenever Father went away,

20:46.705 --> 20:48.145
he would always bring me a gift,

20:48.825 --> 20:50.905
like milk dates, candied fruit,

20:50.985 --> 20:52.385
mooncakes,

20:54.265 --> 20:55.385
and this pear blossom honey.

20:56.305 --> 20:57.385
He really dotes on Your Majesty.

21:19.945 --> 21:22.225
His Majesty arrives!

21:31.025 --> 21:32.065
It's so late.

21:32.145 --> 21:34.025
What brings you here?

21:35.945 --> 21:37.385
I've had two pieces of good news today,

21:37.465 --> 21:38.985
so I wanted to come see my empress.

21:40.025 --> 21:40.865
What good news?

21:42.025 --> 21:43.185
There's hope for my cold sickness.

21:43.785 --> 21:44.945
I no longer have to fear

21:45.025 --> 21:46.825
that one day,
I'll suddenly leave you behind.

22:27.785 --> 22:28.745
What's wrong?

22:30.905 --> 22:33.305
I'm not sure.
I just have a bit of a headache.

22:35.225 --> 22:36.265
Here.

22:54.545 --> 22:55.985
You're burning up.

22:56.945 --> 22:59.025
I'll call the imperial physician
to take a look.

23:00.065 --> 23:01.225
I'm fine.

23:44.585 --> 23:45.465
Sorry.

23:45.985 --> 23:47.225
I lost my composure for a moment.

24:00.785 --> 24:02.185
Get some rest.

25:50.065 --> 25:51.185
Xiao Huan…

25:52.665 --> 25:54.665
should I trust you one more time?

26:11.705 --> 26:13.025
Your Majesty!

26:13.105 --> 26:14.705
Someone, come quickly!

26:19.585 --> 26:21.145
Greetings, Your Majesty.

26:29.025 --> 26:30.905
She has always been in good health.

26:30.985 --> 26:32.305
How could she suddenly pass out?

26:33.665 --> 26:34.785
Your Majesty,

26:34.865 --> 26:36.145
Her Majesty

26:36.665 --> 26:37.745
has been poisoned.

26:38.865 --> 26:39.945
Poisoned?

26:40.465 --> 26:42.145
How could the Empress be poisoned?

26:42.745 --> 26:43.785
What kind of poison is it?

26:44.385 --> 26:46.385
A vicious, rare toxin.

26:46.465 --> 26:47.985
It's already entered
Her Majesty's bloodstream.

26:48.065 --> 26:49.705
Her temperature keeps dropping.

26:50.225 --> 26:53.025
This poison
seems to be suppressing her heartbeat.

26:53.105 --> 26:54.985
If this goes on,
Her Majesty will lose all body heat.

26:55.905 --> 26:56.865
I'm afraid

26:56.945 --> 26:59.385
in a few hours,
there will be no saving her.

27:03.625 --> 27:05.065
How could she be poisoned

27:05.585 --> 27:07.305
here in the inner palace?

27:07.825 --> 27:09.025
She was perfectly fine just yesterday.

27:10.545 --> 27:11.385
Speak!

27:12.505 --> 27:13.625
Your Majesty,

27:13.705 --> 27:14.545
aside from this toxin,

27:14.625 --> 27:16.625
Her Majesty also seems to have taken

27:17.265 --> 27:18.505
Lovesickness Powder.

27:19.025 --> 27:20.305
Lovesickness Powder?

27:21.345 --> 27:22.225
How do we cure it?

27:22.825 --> 27:26.385
I think I've seen it before
at Princess Ying's place.

27:49.745 --> 27:50.905
Don't be afraid.

27:51.465 --> 27:54.065
He said
I shouldn't make things hard for you,

27:54.585 --> 27:56.145
so I won't.

28:00.385 --> 28:01.665
I'll wait for him to come.

28:05.465 --> 28:07.785
I knew it. You were bound to come!

28:11.305 --> 28:12.665
I warned you.

28:12.745 --> 28:14.385
You can hate me, even kill me,

28:14.465 --> 28:16.065
but you may not touch my empress.

28:17.745 --> 28:19.025
Give me the antidote.

28:20.905 --> 28:22.145
What antidote?

28:22.665 --> 28:23.825
I'll say it one more time.

28:24.345 --> 28:25.305
Give me the antidote!

28:31.425 --> 28:32.465
Your Highness.

28:32.985 --> 28:34.465
I've waited for you all day.

28:34.985 --> 28:38.345
Hurry up and tell your master
that I didn't poison the Empress.

28:41.345 --> 28:42.345
Xiao Ying,

28:43.185 --> 28:44.625
I'm not joking with you.

28:45.705 --> 28:47.065
Ying says she didn't.

28:48.465 --> 28:49.665
Your Majesty,

28:50.185 --> 28:51.225
what's going on?

28:52.705 --> 28:54.185
You're not asking what really happened.

28:54.265 --> 28:55.385
You're just lashing out.

28:55.905 --> 28:57.145
Cangcang's poisoned.

28:57.665 --> 28:59.745
The imperial physician says
he's only seen it in the cold palace.

28:59.825 --> 29:02.865
If Ying really used it, would she deny it?

29:03.945 --> 29:06.105
Every day she shouts about killing you.

29:06.625 --> 29:09.145
Has she ever done something
and not owned up to it?

29:10.985 --> 29:14.185
There may be someone trying to frame her.

29:18.305 --> 29:19.185
Your Highness,

29:19.945 --> 29:22.625
the Empress's poison
really wasn't your doing?

29:22.705 --> 29:24.105
You came by yesterday.

29:24.185 --> 29:26.145
You told me to go rest, so I did.

29:26.745 --> 29:28.425
I only just came here to wait for you.

29:28.505 --> 29:29.425
How would I poison anyone?

29:31.345 --> 29:32.425
Is that so?

29:33.065 --> 29:34.225
Since noon yesterday,

29:34.825 --> 29:36.625
Princess Ying hasn't taken a step
out of the cold palace.

29:37.225 --> 29:39.145
I stake my life on it.

29:41.145 --> 29:42.945
After the Empress was poisoned,
her whole body turned cold

29:43.585 --> 29:44.985
and the veins in her face
went blue and purple.

29:46.425 --> 29:47.745
What kind of poison is this?

29:47.825 --> 29:48.745
Is there an antidote?

29:51.945 --> 29:53.945
It sounds like…

29:54.465 --> 29:55.545
Frostflower.

29:57.505 --> 29:58.905
But I don't have an antidote.

29:59.705 --> 30:01.105
I only brew poisons to kill you.

30:01.185 --> 30:02.265
Why would I bother making antidotes?

30:04.945 --> 30:06.105
Can you make one or not?

30:08.305 --> 30:09.625
I already said there is no antidote.

30:10.505 --> 30:13.865
Her temples have gone purple,
which means she'll be dead in a few hours.

30:15.065 --> 30:17.345
Even if someone can make an antidote,
she won't live to see it.

30:22.545 --> 30:24.105
-Li Hongqing.
-Here.

30:24.625 --> 30:25.745
Go to Nanrong Palace at once.

30:25.825 --> 30:26.825
Understood.

30:31.625 --> 30:32.465
Your Majesty.

30:33.465 --> 30:36.105
As for this matter,
you haven't told Preceptor Du, have you?

30:36.705 --> 30:37.745
No.

30:41.745 --> 30:42.745
Your Majesty…

30:42.825 --> 30:43.665
Let go.

30:44.505 --> 30:46.225
Imperial Physician Li has searched
for ten years for it.

30:47.305 --> 30:48.505
It's your lifesaving medicine.

30:50.145 --> 30:51.345
Ten years, that's all.

30:51.865 --> 30:52.985
I managed to wait before.

30:53.505 --> 30:55.625
-I can keep waiting now.
-Your Majesty…

30:58.985 --> 31:00.025
Go back.

31:00.105 --> 31:01.545
You should know

31:02.065 --> 31:05.025
that once I've made a decision,
no one can change it.

31:07.985 --> 31:09.025
Yes, Your Majesty.

31:16.785 --> 31:17.865
Your Majesty.

31:18.665 --> 31:19.865
Xiaoshan,

31:19.945 --> 31:22.145
grind this into powder,
mix it with water and bring it in.

31:22.225 --> 31:24.345
I will use it to cleanse the poison
from the Empress.

31:24.425 --> 31:26.305
Yes, Your Majesty. I'll go at once.

31:43.745 --> 31:45.705
Commander Li took away the Frost Reed.

31:46.265 --> 31:48.305
Is it because
Imperial Physician Li is back?

31:48.385 --> 31:49.625
Seems not.

31:49.705 --> 31:50.625
Commander Li said

31:50.705 --> 31:53.825
if you return,
you'd better go straight to Linghe Hall.

32:43.265 --> 32:44.865
Madam, you can't go in!

32:44.945 --> 32:46.585
Madam!

33:01.745 --> 33:03.385
The Empress is about to wake.

33:03.465 --> 33:06.265
If you have something to say,
we can talk in Wuying Hall.

33:34.705 --> 33:36.025
There's no need for this.

33:37.025 --> 33:38.185
I'm not dead yet.

33:38.825 --> 33:43.065
You can't afford to wait another ten years
for the Frost Reed.

33:44.505 --> 33:46.065
There may still be hope.

33:47.465 --> 33:50.145
From now on, I will do exactly as you say.

33:50.665 --> 33:51.985
I'll take the medicine and the needles

33:52.065 --> 33:53.305
without so much as a frown.

33:55.745 --> 33:57.305
Who did this?

33:57.985 --> 33:58.905
I'll investigate at once.

34:00.985 --> 34:01.865
No need.

34:02.825 --> 34:05.265
At first, I thought it was Xiao Ying.

34:06.025 --> 34:07.705
But when I returned to Linghe Hall

34:07.785 --> 34:09.625
and checked everything carefully,

34:09.705 --> 34:10.985
I understood.

34:17.225 --> 34:18.304
This

34:18.385 --> 34:21.145
is the pear blossom honey
Cangcang has loved since childhood.

34:21.905 --> 34:24.385
Yesterday, Grand Tutor Ling sent it over.

34:26.465 --> 34:28.905
And the poison was hidden right inside it.

34:31.185 --> 34:32.585
The imperial physician also said

34:32.665 --> 34:34.625
that in what Cangcang was given,

34:34.705 --> 34:36.264
there was not only a fatal toxin

34:37.264 --> 34:38.625
but also Lovesickness Powder.

35:01.505 --> 35:03.225
We found an important lead:

35:03.305 --> 35:05.625
the cure for His Majesty's cold sickness,
the rare Frost Reed,

35:05.705 --> 35:06.945
has finally been found.

35:09.785 --> 35:11.785
If we lay the Lovesickness Powder
and the poison

35:13.145 --> 35:15.905
only on the very top layer of honey,

35:15.985 --> 35:18.345
can you guarantee
the honey beneath is clean?

35:19.065 --> 35:20.145
I can, my lord.

35:20.225 --> 35:22.145
I once trained under the Tang Clan.

35:22.225 --> 35:24.065
I would never leave any trace behind.

35:24.145 --> 35:25.385
You may rest assured.

35:26.665 --> 35:27.705
This poison

35:28.545 --> 35:29.865
was stolen from Princess Ying

35:29.945 --> 35:31.905
by an undercover agent in the palace,
wasn't it?

35:31.985 --> 35:33.025
Yes.

35:33.105 --> 35:34.465
I heard

35:34.545 --> 35:36.425
His Majesty has already visited
the cold palace

35:36.505 --> 35:37.985
and seems to have cleared Princess Ying.

35:39.185 --> 35:40.545
It doesn't matter.

35:40.625 --> 35:42.145
With no solid proof,

35:42.225 --> 35:44.225
even if His Majesty suspects something,

35:44.305 --> 35:47.185
this case can only be left hanging.

35:51.625 --> 35:52.785
Speak.

35:55.065 --> 35:55.905
My lord,

35:56.465 --> 35:58.945
this Frostflower poison
is incredibly vicious.

35:59.025 --> 36:00.985
If used carelessly, it could take a life.

36:01.065 --> 36:03.945
Are you truly not worried
about Young Lady?

36:11.145 --> 36:13.065
If you had a daughter

36:15.265 --> 36:17.505
who grew up fair and clever,

36:17.585 --> 36:19.505
treasured like a pearl in your palm,

36:22.625 --> 36:24.465
could you not worry,

36:25.345 --> 36:26.465
not feel pain?

36:27.425 --> 36:30.305
I've long since prepared the antidote.

36:33.305 --> 36:34.705
In the last round,

36:35.505 --> 36:37.185
I lost.

36:38.625 --> 36:40.185
So I decided

36:41.265 --> 36:43.025
to place one more bet.

36:43.665 --> 36:45.985
I bet that someone else's feelings
for Cangcang

36:47.585 --> 36:49.265
run deeper

36:50.385 --> 36:51.425
than mine.

36:52.545 --> 36:53.745
He's gambling.

36:53.825 --> 36:56.825
Word about the Frost Reed
must have leaked out.

36:57.465 --> 36:58.425
He's betting

36:58.505 --> 37:01.465
that I won't just stand by and watch
Cangcang die,

37:02.225 --> 37:05.065
that I'll definitely use the Frost Reed
to save her life.

37:06.385 --> 37:07.345
And once I do,

37:07.865 --> 37:09.345
I won't live much longer.

37:09.945 --> 37:11.545
He can pin it all on Xiao Ying,

37:12.065 --> 37:14.585
and even stir up strife
between me and the Empress Dowager.

37:15.185 --> 37:16.265
And after that,

37:16.785 --> 37:18.985
if the Empress conceives my heir,

37:19.065 --> 37:22.465
this round
really will be three birds with one stone.

37:23.945 --> 37:25.105
As for this,

37:26.105 --> 37:28.025
you already knew it

37:28.825 --> 37:30.545
before treating the Empress?

37:37.465 --> 37:39.425
This matter cannot simply be let go!

37:43.105 --> 37:45.465
Are you really going to wait

37:46.705 --> 37:49.345
and let Ling Xuefeng
become regent again one day?

38:03.305 --> 38:05.105
You must not soften again.

38:06.825 --> 38:09.025
If the Empress bears an heir,

38:09.545 --> 38:11.385
Ling Xuefeng will surely rebel.

38:11.465 --> 38:13.385
As Grand Tutor Ling is now,

38:14.585 --> 38:16.225
he's resorting to desperate measures.

38:34.465 --> 38:37.065
LINGHE HALL

38:57.505 --> 38:59.105
You must not soften again.

39:00.465 --> 39:02.625
If the Empress bears an heir,

39:03.145 --> 39:04.145
Ling Xuefeng will surely rebel.

39:08.665 --> 39:09.825
You're awake.

39:17.465 --> 39:18.505
What happened to me?

39:20.465 --> 39:21.545
You were poisoned.

39:35.465 --> 39:36.465
Poisoned?

39:37.745 --> 39:39.065
Who did it?

39:43.025 --> 39:44.025
The Empress Dowager?

39:46.745 --> 39:47.985
It doesn't matter anymore.

39:48.665 --> 39:49.865
What matters is,

39:50.585 --> 39:51.745
the poison has been cleared.

39:55.305 --> 39:57.105
People in this inner palace

39:58.745 --> 40:00.745
are truly like beasts let loose.

40:12.745 --> 40:13.785
What's wrong?

40:14.305 --> 40:15.785
You look so grim.

40:27.545 --> 40:28.985
Before the medicine cools,

40:30.025 --> 40:30.985
hurry and drink it.

40:47.265 --> 40:48.745
What kind of medicine is this?

40:48.825 --> 40:50.025
Is it bitter?

40:50.545 --> 40:51.385
Birth-control tea.

41:33.305 --> 41:34.505
What

41:37.065 --> 41:37.985
is that supposed to mean?

41:41.545 --> 41:43.865
It's mixed by Preceptor Du.

41:44.865 --> 41:47.185
It won't do your body much harm.

41:47.825 --> 41:50.145
Take it and it'll work at once.

41:50.945 --> 41:53.185
It can spare you and me

41:53.985 --> 41:55.505
a great deal of trouble.

42:09.945 --> 42:11.225
What trouble?

42:16.625 --> 42:17.745
So…

42:18.865 --> 42:20.425
everything that happened yesterday

42:22.305 --> 42:24.145
was all just an act?

42:33.305 --> 42:35.185
That was three days ago.

42:36.265 --> 42:38.185
You've been unconscious for two days.

42:39.145 --> 42:40.625
Three days apart,

42:41.705 --> 42:43.185
your heart has already changed.

42:47.545 --> 42:49.305
So your love

42:52.185 --> 42:53.945
is just a whim.

42:55.625 --> 42:57.185
Once the mood passes,

42:59.105 --> 43:00.745
you throw it away.

43:03.745 --> 43:04.785
Is that it?
